{"bookId": "3300024289", "title": "叫魂：1768年中国妖术大恐慌", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1682100743, "updated": [{"bookId": "3300024289", "bookmarkId": "3300024289_14_1063-1108", "createTime": 1675227538, "range": "4261-4306", "markText": "发生于清初的那些令人毛骨悚然的剃发事件也许能揭示，在弘历的微笑里可以包含着多么阴暗的含义。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 62}, {"bookId": "3300024289", "bookmarkId": "3300024289_14_784-822", "createTime": 1675143769, "range": "3982-4020", "markText": "到了弘历当政的时候，清朝大一统帝国为自身存在所作的装点与辩解看来已大体完成。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 62}, {"bookId": "3300024289", "bookmarkId": "3300024289_13_1619-1819", "createTime": 1675143203, "range": "1588-1702", "markText": "即位之初，弘历将自己的年号定为“乾隆”。帝国的一份诏谕曾经解释道（但并非提供正式的文字诠释）：新继位的君主从上天（“乾”）得到了不可胜数的支持（“隆”），他将以自己的全副身心（乾惕）使得父皇留下的“丰功盛德”得以进一步发扬光大。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 62}, {"bookId": "3300024289", "bookmarkId": "3300024289_12_5136-5286", "createTime": 1674988116, "range": "13388-13538", "markText": "颇有意思的是，社会史家们通过来自位于这一地区西南角的徽州商人在全国范围内取得的成功，来说明清代的商业生活是何等生气勃勃。然而，徽州本地的经济，却与我们刚刚作过描绘的广德的情况非常相近：这里地处丘陵，土地贫瘠，因沿海地区过于拥挤而离乡背井的无地农民来这里安身立命，这是一个相对来说尚未商业化的农业地区。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 61}, {"bookId": "3300024289", "bookmarkId": "3300024289_11_6040-6272", "createTime": 1674979334, "range": "6655-6887", "markText": "很显然，“除贱为良”的目的在于通过废除平民中的“贱人”身份，使得“臣民”这一群体不因其中特殊下层社会集团的存在而显得杂乱无章。对于这些法令为什么会在十八世纪二十年代发布的确切原因，我们仍不太清楚。但从更一般性的角度来看，这肯定同满人对汉人上层地主的不信任有关（这些被解放的奴仆正是依赖这些上层地主为生的）；同时，这样做既是对汉人长期以来划分社会等级的做法的一种嘲弄，也表达了征服者的某种“仁慈”，从而使得清朝政权能够更好地高居于相对来说已无显著差异的芸芸众生之上。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 61}, {"bookId": "3300024289", "bookmarkId": "3300024289_11_5522-5592", "createTime": 1674979218, "range": "6137-6207", "markText": "明朝初年曾实行过一种世袭身份制度，数以百万计的人均需特别注册，并被迫在特定的行业中为政府工作。满人入主中原之后不久，这种制度便被正式废除了。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 61}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "第三章 或现或隐的威胁", "chapterUid": 62, "chapterIdx": 6}, {"title": "第二章 盛世", "chapterUid": 61, "chapterIdx": 5}], "book": {"bookId": "3300024289", "version": 788004184, "format": "epub", "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/3300024289/s_3300024289.jpg", "title": "叫魂：1768年中国妖术大恐慌", "author": "孔飞力", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "K47U3nx]0zF0s:,?IoaKoe", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#0f1b35"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#021b41"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#00194d"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#24304b"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#1a3058"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#042f65"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#3a4765"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#304772"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#23477e"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#004598"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#4b6089"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#3160a3"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#54607c"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#4f7abd"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#6d7a94"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#5b7ab0"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#8794ad"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#7f94bc"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#7594ca"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#5994e8"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#8eaee6"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#81aff7"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#6eafff"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#bac9e2"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#afc9f4"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#88c9ff"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#dee3ed"}, {"key": "9/12", "hex": "#9fe5ff"}, {"key": "1/100", "hex": "#7594ca"}, {"key": "2/100", "hex": "#8eaee6"}, {"key": "3/100", "hex": "#ffffff"}, {"key": "4/100", "hex": "#E5E5F3"}, {"key": "5/100", "hex": "#E5E5F3"}, {"key": "6/100", "hex": "#000427"}], "dominate_color": {"hex": "#2d313d", "hsv": [224.6889934333877, 27.016559739343656, 23.978733499042697]}, "custom_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookalphacover/289/3300024289/s_3300024289.jpg", "custom_rec_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookreccover/289/3300024289/s_3300024289.jpg", "colorsPure": ["#5994e8", "#6eafff"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7FNU5maXM", "review": {"bookVersion": 2051193777, "bookId": "3300024289", "content": "一个没有法治，愚昧，皇权专制的社会。", "type": 4, "star": 100, "reviewId": "17408780_7FNU5maXM", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1675601532, "flag": 0, "newRatingLevel": 1, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300024289", "format": "epub", "version": 788004184, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/3300024289/s_3300024289.jpg", "title": "叫魂：1768年中国妖术大恐慌", "author": "孔飞力", "translator": "陈兼 刘昶", "payType": 1048577}, "bookFinderSuccessCount": 0, "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7FHkQUkfv", "review": {"bookId": "3300024289", "content": "看到这里，再想想那些剃了头的风云人物人物，左宗棠，曾国藩，黄飞鸿，刘罗锅，纪晓岚，也都只能算是半个好汉，另外半个已经被剃掉了。", "bookVersion": 2051193777, "range": "7141-7210", "abstract": "这样一来，削发令又成了一项极为精明的行动：与其让那种不温不火对待新政权的消极态度得到滋养生长，毋宁让这种抵抗一下子爆发出来而迅速予以荡平。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 62, "reviewId": "17408780_7FHkQUkfv", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1675228452, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300024289", "format": "epub", "version": 788004184, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/3300024289/s_3300024289.jpg", "title": "叫魂：1768年中国妖术大恐慌", "author": "孔飞力", "translator": "陈兼 刘昶", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 6, "chapterTitle": "第三章 或现或隐的威胁", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 3}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7FDyettCw", "review": {"bookId": "3300024289", "content": "拿僧侣与太监相提并论，是个有趣的角度。", "bookVersion": 2051193777, "range": "21768-21819", "abstract": "在这方面，僧人的情况与受人歧视的太监相似——太监为了饭碗的缘故，而摒弃了生养后代这一最重要的尽孝的义务", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 61, "reviewId": "17408780_7FDyettCw", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1675013509, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300024289", "format": "epub", "version": 788004184, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/3300024289/s_3300024289.jpg", "title": "叫魂：1768年中国妖术大恐慌", "author": "孔飞力", "translator": "陈兼 刘昶", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "第二章 盛世", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7FDy0LbCe", "review": {"bookId": "3300024289", "content": "户籍制度最早是社会维稳的一个重要手段，然而随着互联网等技术手段的兴起，维稳功能在逐渐减弱。", "bookVersion": 2051193777, "range": "20802-20893", "abstract": "大多数被通缉的人犯都换上了僧道服装，销声匿迹，远遁外地。这就是为什么“至如妖言妖书等重大案件，每案必有外来奸僧邪道主持，煽惑良由”。因为这些人居无定所，要追寻他们的踪迹也就极为困难。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 61, "reviewId": "17408780_7FDy0LbCe", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1675013307, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300024289", "format": "epub", "version": 788004184, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/3300024289/s_3300024289.jpg", "title": "叫魂：1768年中国妖术大恐慌", "author": "孔飞力", "translator": "陈兼 刘昶", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "第二章 盛世", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 1, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7FD5w07Dl", "review": {"bookId": "3300024289", "content": "然而通货膨胀的原因绝不是仅仅因为货币供应量增加了，这里另需专门研究。", "bookVersion": 2051193777, "range": "11297-11357", "abstract": "这种转变的一种解释，便是货币供应总量的增加。当每个人手里都有更多钱时，商品出售者就可以对所有种类的商品都开出更高的价格了", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 61, "reviewId": "17408780_7FD5w07Dl", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1674987200, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300024289", "format": "epub", "version": 788004184, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/3300024289/s_3300024289.jpg", "title": "叫魂：1768年中国妖术大恐慌", "author": "孔飞力", "translator": "陈兼 刘昶", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "第二章 盛世", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7FCXpdT7h", "review": {"bookId": "3300024289", "content": "没有基本保障的“自由”带来的是恐惧，而恐惧就限制了人民去争取自由。政治的进步的基石是知识，是科学技术，是劳动力的效率提升，否则都是空谈。", "chapterUid": 61, "type": 1, "bookVersion": 2051193777, "reviewId": "17408780_7FCXpdT7h", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1674979771, "oldchapterUid": 11, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300024289", "format": "epub", "version": 788004184, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/3300024289/s_3300024289.jpg", "title": "叫魂：1768年中国妖术大恐慌", "author": "孔飞力", "translator": "陈兼 刘昶", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 5, "chapterTitle": "第二章 盛世", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 10}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7FBIpXNJ3", "review": {"bookId": "3300024289", "content": "即使在清朝，死刑已经比较谨慎了，需要皇帝过目。", "bookVersion": 2051193777, "range": "23425-23524", "abstract": "当然，根据《大清律例》，某些弄神弄鬼的行为是杀头之罪，一个妖党疑犯因而是可以被起诉的。但是，既然所有判处死刑的案子都要受到直到最高一级官府的复查并最终要由皇帝本人过目，那么，证据还是要充实一些才好。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 60, "reviewId": "17408780_7FBIpXNJ3", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1674909240, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300024289", "format": "epub", "version": 788004184, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/89/3300024289/s_3300024289.jpg", "title": "叫魂：1768年中国妖术大恐慌", "author": "孔飞力", "translator": "陈兼 刘昶", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 4, "chapterTitle": "第一章 中国窃贼传奇", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3Vt